<div class="section-head"><div><h2>Inventory catalogue</h2><p>Products, batch tracking, suppliers, warehouses, and inter-warehouse transfers.</p></div></div><div class="panel"><div class="table-toolbar"><input class="resource-search" id="inventorySearch" placeholder="Search inventory…"><span class="muted" id="resourceCount">Loading…</span></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>ITEM</th><th>SKU</th><th>SUPPLIER</th><th>AVAILABLE</th><th>REORDER LEVEL</th><th>STATUS</th></tr></thead><tbody id="resourceRows"><tr><td colspan="6" class="empty">Loading inventory…</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
<div class="section-head"><div><h2>Batch tracking</h2><p>Batch numbers, manufacturing dates, expiry dates, and supplier records.</p></div></div><div class="panel"><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>BATCH</th><th>ITEM</th><th>MANUFACTURED</th><th>EXPIRES</th><th>SUPPLIER</th></tr></thead><tbody id="batchRows"><tr><td colspan="5" class="empty">Loading batches…</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
<div class="section-head"><div><h2>Supplier database</h2><p>Supplier contacts and lead times.</p></div></div><div class="panel"><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>SUPPLIER</th><th>CONTACT</th><th>EMAIL</th><th>PHONE</th><th>LEAD TIME</th></tr></thead><tbody id="supplierRows"><tr><td colspan="5" class="empty">Loading suppliers…</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
<div class="section-head"><div><h2>Warehouses</h2><p>All active stock locations.</p></div></div><div class="panel"><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>WAREHOUSE</th><th>CODE</th><th>ADDRESS</th></tr></thead><tbody id="warehouseRows"><tr><td colspan="3" class="empty">Loading warehouses…</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>

<div class="section-head"><div><h2>Register a batch</h2><p>Add a new product batch and optionally record its opening stock.</p></div></div><div class="panel form-panel"><form id="batchForm" class="form-grid"><label>Product<select name="item_id" id="batchItem" required><option value="">Select product</option></select></label><label>Batch number<input name="batch_number" required maxlength="80"></label><label>Manufacturing date<input type="date" name="manufacturing_date" required></label><label>Expiration date<input type="date" name="expiration_date" required></label><label>Supplier<select name="supplier_id" id="batchSupplier"><option value="">No supplier</option></select></label><label>Unit cost<input type="number" name="unit_cost" min="0" step="0.01" value="0"></label><label>Opening quantity<input type="number" name="initial_quantity" min="0" value="0" required></label><label>Warehouse<select name="warehouse_id" id="batchWarehouse"><option value="">Select warehouse if quantity is added</option></select></label><button class="btn primary" type="submit">Register batch</button></form></div>
<div class="section-head"><div><h2>Stock movement</h2><p>Record received stock, issued stock, or write-offs against a batch and warehouse.</p></div></div><div class="panel form-panel"><form id="movementForm" class="form-grid"><label>Batch<select name="batch_id" id="movementBatch" required><option value="">Select batch</option></select></label><label>Warehouse<select name="warehouse_id" id="movementWarehouse" required><option value="">Select warehouse</option></select></label><label>Movement type<select name="type" required><option value="receive">Receive stock</option><option value="issue">Issue stock</option><option value="write_off">Write off</option></select></label><label>Quantity<input type="number" name="quantity" min="1" required></label><label class="span-2">Reason<input name="reason" maxlength="255" required placeholder="Reason for this stock movement"></label><button class="btn primary" type="submit">Save stock movement</button></form></div>
<div class="section-head"><div><h2>Inter-warehouse transfer</h2><p>Move stock between warehouses. Transfers are recorded in the history below.</p></div></div><div class="panel form-panel"><form id="transferForm" class="form-grid"><label>Batch<select name="batch_id" id="transferBatch" required><option value="">Select batch</option></select></label><label>From warehouse<select name="from_warehouse_id" id="transferFrom" required><option value="">Select source</option></select></label><label>To warehouse<select name="to_warehouse_id" id="transferTo" required><option value="">Select destination</option></select></label><label>Quantity<input type="number" name="quantity" min="1" required></label><label class="span-2">Notes<input name="notes" maxlength="255" placeholder="Optional transfer note"></label><button class="btn primary" type="submit">Create transfer</button></form></div>
<div class="section-head"><div><h2>Transfer history</h2><p>Recent completed movements between warehouses.</p></div></div><div class="panel"><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>TRANSFER</th><th>FROM</th><th>TO</th><th>DATE</th></tr></thead><tbody id="transferRows"><tr><td colspan="4" class="empty">Loading transfer history…</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>